WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.766
The paper proves three links in a triangle
connecting memorization,

00:00:04.846 --> 00:00:08.166
input loss curvature, and differential privacy.

00:00:08.246 --> 00:00:11.276
First, curvature upper-bounds memorization.

00:00:11.356 --> 00:00:15.688
Second, the privacy parameter upper-bounds average
curvature.

00:00:15.768 --> 00:00:18.871
Third, privacy bounds memorization directly.

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:23.717
None assume Hessian convexity, so they hold for
real deep networks,

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:26.610
and all three are validated empirically.
